[i]You can't really sleep after the fight earlier. You toss and turn in bed. You can't help but feel like you made the wrong choice by kicking out {FoShi.name}. You look at your bedside clock.[/i]
[i]It's around midnight. Suddenly, there's a knock on the door.[/i]
[i]You get out of bed and look through the peephole in the door. {Silas.name} is on the other side. He looks disheveled, like he had been doing nothing but pulling out his hair since dinner.[/i]
